msgstr "Ellenőriztük a hitelkártyádat. Ha a kártya érvényes, a felnőtt tartalom hamarosan elérhetővé válik. Bezárhatod ezt a lapot, és visszatérhetsz az alkalmazásba."

#. Screen share notice shown to the person sharing when their device is the limit and nothing lower is available. frameRate is the whole number of frames a second the stream is set to send and deliveredFrameRate is the smaller whole number that reaches viewers. Keep the two rates in separate clauses so neither can be read as the other. resolution is a technical token such as 720p. FPS is a technical token.
#: src/features/voice/utils/VoiceMessageDescriptors.ts:361
msgid "Your device cannot keep up. Your stream is set to {frameRate} FPS at {resolution} and viewers are getting about {deliveredFrameRate} FPS."
msgstr "Eszközöd nem bírja. A stream beállítása {frameRate} FPS és {resolution} felbontás, a nézők pedig körülbelül {deliveredFrameRate} FPS-t kapnak."

#. Screen share notice shown to the person sharing after their stream dropped frame rate to protect sharpness. frameRate is a whole number and resolution is a technical token such as 1080p or 2714x762. FPS is a technical token.
#: src/features/voice/utils/VoiceMessageDescriptors.ts:339
msgid "Your device could not keep up, so your stream now sends {frameRate} FPS to keep {resolution} sharp."
msgstr "Eszközöd nem tudta tartani a lépést, ezért a stream most {frameRate} FPS-t küld, hogy éles maradjon a(z) {resolution} felbontás."

#. Screen share notice shown to the person sharing after their stream dropped both resolution and frame rate. resolution and frameRate are what the stream sends now, targetResolution and targetFrameRate are what the person asked for. Resolutions are technical tokens such as 480p and rates are whole numbers. FPS is a technical token.
#: src/features/voice/utils/VoiceMessageDescriptors.ts:349
msgid "Your device could not keep up, so your stream now sends {resolution} at {frameRate} FPS instead of {targetResolution} at {targetFrameRate} FPS."
msgstr "Eszközöd nem bírta a tempót, ezért a streamed most {resolution} képkocka/mp sebességgel küld {frameRate} FPS helyett, {targetResolution} {targetFrameRate} FPS helyett."

#. Screen share notice shown to the person sharing after their stream dropped resolution to protect smoothness. resolution is a technical token such as 720p and frameRate is a whole number. FPS is a technical token.
#: src/features/voice/utils/VoiceMessageDescriptors.ts:344
msgid "Your device could not keep up, so your stream now sends {resolution} to keep {frameRate} FPS smooth."
msgstr "Eszközöd nem tudta tartani a lépést, ezért a stream most {resolution} küld, hogy a(z) {frameRate} FPS akadásmentes maradjon."

